{"result":{"finish_reason":"eos","image_tokens":693,"precision":"int8_weights_dynamic_activations","text":"<|det|>text [37, 43, 280, 74]<|/det|>社区图书馆开放通知\n<|det|>text [37, 86, 430, 115]<|/det|>COMMUNITY LIBRARY NOTICE\n<|det|>text [37, 167, 406, 197]<|/det|>开放日期：二零二六年十月五日\n<|det|>text [37, 207, 396, 239]<|/det|>Opening date: 5 October 2026\n<|det|>text [37, 288, 434, 320]<|/det|>周一至周五：上午九点至下午六点\n<|det|>text [37, 330, 331, 360]<|/det|>Saturday: 10:00 to 16:00\n<|det|>text [39, 368, 184, 399]<|/det|>星期日闭馆。\n<|det|>text [37, 449, 444, 480]<|/det|>一楼设有借阅服务台和报刊阅读区。\n<|det|>text [37, 489, 418, 520]<|/det|>二楼提供自习座位和小组讨论室。\n<|det|>text [37, 530, 418, 561]<|/det|>请保持安静，并将手机调至静音。\n<|det|>text [37, 613, 502, 643]<|/det|>Borrow up to six books for three weeks.\n<|det|>text [37, 653, 516, 683]<|/det|>Return books at the main entrance desk.\n<|det|>text [37, 694, 393, 724]<|/det|>Please bring your library card.\n<|det|>text [37, 775, 351, 806]<|/det|>咨询电话：010-5550-2186\n<|det|>text [37, 816, 415, 848]<|/det|>服务邮箱：library@example.org\n<|det|>text [37, 856, 418, 886]<|/det|>欢迎居民和访客使用图书馆服务。","timings":{"decode_seconds":2.517040036000002,"decode_steps":384,"first_token_seconds":5.259019125,"prefill_seconds":1.3901032500000001,"preprocess_seconds":0.060917625,"total_seconds":7.8081615,"vision_seconds":3.807905084},"token_ids":[128818,2067,764,1942,14,223,3354,14,223,13161,14,223,6048,63,128819,8407,20978,10934,10321,201,128818,2067,764,1942,14,223,5926,14,223,18736,14,223,8059,63,128819,59198,6901,14167,79662,52,17617,11388,18768,201,128818,2067,764,1942,14,223,11185,14,223,20544,14,223,2254,63,128819,10934,14590,768,114322,1304,42986,47083,113983,201,128818,2067,764,1942,14,223,13423,14,223,21834,14,223,16146,63,128819,98184,5045,28,223,23,5857,223,939,24,201,128818,2067,764,1942,14,223,17391,14,223,22741,14,223,12715,63,128819,59289,1868,59237,768,16410,4051,985,1868,12279,3377,985,201,128818,2067,764,1942,14,223,14461,14,223,17922,14,223,10758,63,128819,42151,28,223,553,28,504,304,